          "date": "2026-11-13 07:49:25.000000000",
          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-21191 tests: wait for admin sync in fops_test_setup",
        "message": "LU-21191 tests: wait for admin sync in fops_test_setup\n\nfops_test_setup() sets c0 admin and trusted to 1 so the test\ndirectory can be created as root, then restores both, but only\nwaits for trusted_nodemap to sync. In sanity-sec test_21 trusted\nis already 1, so that wait passes before the admin change reaches\nthe other MDS, and creating the directory on a remote MDT fails\nwith EPERM because root is still squashed there. The test then\nfails with \"cannot chmod mapped_trusted_noadmin\".\n\nAlso wait for admin_nodemap whenever admin is not already 1.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-sec env=ONLY=\"16 17 18 19 20 21 22\",ONLY_REPEAT=4 mdscount=2 mdtcount=4\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I839e8ce9d053341766c1e4a42fe4f8b1386e166b\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
      "description": "Edit commit message"
    }
  },
